  "body": "The formatting conventions used in this spec seem to be different (and slightly less informative) than those of some of the other specs; for example (taking WHATWG HTML as gospel):\n- ``%`` or `0x22` vs. `0x2F (ASCII %)`\n- `\"%\"` vs. `U+0025 PERCENT SIGN (%)`\n\nWould you be open to pull requests changing the former to the latter?\n",
